{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"manual perspective plane scene extraction manual perspective plane scene extraction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","fileName":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Matte Painting and Scene Finishing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"manual perspective plane scene extraction manual perspective plane scene extraction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","fileName":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction","heading":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Perspective lines in a photograph can guide a connected set of floor, wall, ceiling, and recess planes. The book builds a hallway this way with Photoshop's Vanishing Point grids, extending each new plane from an existing edge so its orientation remains related to the rest. Exporting the planes yields a basic textured 3D environment that can be lit or used with an added CG character. A mismatched starting grid propagates through later planes, so visible lines such as floor tiles should be aligned carefully.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"manual perspective plane scene extraction manual perspective plane scene extraction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","fileName":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Manual Perspective-Plane Scene Extraction","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Matte Painting and Scene Finishing","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}